# Data, outputs, and build artifacts live on D drive via symlinks; never
# commit them. Patterns with leading slash match the symlink itself
# (treated as a regular path by git); the trailing-slash variants match
# any real-dir version in case the symlinks are ever absent.
/data
/output
/runs
/inference
/dist
/build
data/
output/
runs/
inference/

# Logs and scratch
*.log
scratch/

